    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hunted Within: The Walls&quot; is a gripping first-person horror  survival game that throws you into a terrifying world inspired by the intensity of Maze Runner, the visceral combat of Dying Light, and the adrenaline-pumping stealth of Outlast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/e2660b21f6ca1bff4af637dc891288bf.poster.avif?t=1755195414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/e2660b21f6ca1bff4af637dc891288bf.webm?t=1755195414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/e2660b21f6ca1bff4af637dc891288bf.mp4?t=1755195414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost with no memory, trapped behind massive walls, and must venture through eerie areas Each delivers a unique horror experience, pushing your courage and curiosity to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/d829e2201b49826385089d98e1a4c6ce.poster.avif?t=1755195414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/d829e2201b49826385089d98e1a4c6ce.webm?t=1755195414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/d829e2201b49826385089d98e1a4c6ce.mp4?t=1755195414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly dangerous enemies, from silent stalkers in the forest to horrors lurking in the caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/68e57a3ff693aecfa20c3fdf7bd7df82.poster.avif?t=1755195414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/68e57a3ff693aecfa20c3fdf7bd7df82.webm?t=1755195414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/68e57a3ff693aecfa20c3fdf7bd7df82.mp4?t=1755195414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and\u00a0blueprints  to craft deadly weapons, Items and survival gear that will help you stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth hidden within the maze by hunting down rare Artifact Stones\u2014essential keys throughout the story, and Find out who's Behind all of this!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hunted Within: The Walls&quot; is a gripping first-person horror  survival game that throws you into a terrifying world inspired by the intensity of Maze Runner, the visceral combat of Dying Light, and the adrenaline-pumping stealth of Outlast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/e2660b21f6ca1bff4af637dc891288bf.poster.avif?t=1755195414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/e2660b21f6ca1bff4af637dc891288bf.webm?t=1755195414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/e2660b21f6ca1bff4af637dc891288bf.mp4?t=1755195414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost with no memory, trapped behind massive walls, and must venture through eerie areas Each delivers a unique horror experience, pushing your courage and curiosity to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/d829e2201b49826385089d98e1a4c6ce.poster.avif?t=1755195414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/d829e2201b49826385089d98e1a4c6ce.webm?t=1755195414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/d829e2201b49826385089d98e1a4c6ce.mp4?t=1755195414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly dangerous enemies, from silent stalkers in the forest to horrors lurking in the caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/68e57a3ff693aecfa20c3fdf7bd7df82.poster.avif?t=1755195414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/68e57a3ff693aecfa20c3fdf7bd7df82.webm?t=1755195414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/68e57a3ff693aecfa20c3fdf7bd7df82.mp4?t=1755195414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and\u00a0blueprints  to craft deadly weapons, Items and survival gear that will help you stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth hidden within the maze by hunting down rare Artifact Stones\u2014essential keys throughout the story, and Find out who's Behind all of this!</p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into a gripping first-person horror Survival game Where you're trapped in a terrifying towering maze. Explore, craft tools and Fight by day, watch out over night when the Darkness hunts you within the walls. Uncover the truth behind the walls and Escape, or become a part of the nightmare.",
